#: ../../source/docs/common-pxfmini-wiring-quick-start.rst:9
#: 8d0725f703474722ae7c7ea03873d7be
msgid ""
"PXFmini uses JST-GH connectors instead of DF13. This is the latest adoption "
"made by the DroneCode Foundation"
msgstr "PXFmini 使用 JST-GH 连接器，而非 DF13。这是 DroneCode 基金会最新采用的标准。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pxfmini-wiring-quick-start.rst:15
#: 2910204dc6ef4536b13e3efdb8196124
msgid ""
"This article provides high level information about how to power "
":ref:`PXFmini<common-pxfmini>` and connect its most important peripherals."
msgstr "本文提供 :ref:`PXFmini<common-pxfmini>` 供电及重要外设连接的高层次说明。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pxfmini-wiring-quick-start.rst:22
#: 9609d8bc328949e98399b5014c91773f
msgid "PXFmini Wiring Chart"
msgstr "PXFmini 接线图"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pxfmini-wiring-quick-start.rst:30
#: 105422f221824c599c7bcf54c602d8b5
msgid "Power PXFmini"
msgstr "PXFmini 供电"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pxfmini-wiring-quick-start.rst:32
#: 7e393d960b794e2fb351b609c1d6bb95
msgid ""
"PXFmini is typically powered via its \"power\" port, as shown in the picture"
" below. The power port simultaneously powers PXFmini and reads voltage and "
"current analog measurements."
msgstr "PXFmini 通常通过其「power」接口供电，如下图所示。power 接口同时为 PXFmini 供电并读取电压和电流模拟测量值。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pxfmini-wiring-quick-start.rst:36
#: c5a13ac8d9e44136bbfd99bbc552947f
msgid ""
"It can be also powered using a BEC, you just need to connect to the PWM "
"rail."
msgstr "也可通过 BEC 供电，只需连接到 PWM 轨即可。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pxfmini-wiring-quick-start.rst:38
#: d6d57878e72c4f8ebf9a5ec4982d6c4e
msgid ""
"Additionally, for developing/configuration purposes, it can be powered using"
" a micro USB charger (2A recommended)."
msgstr "此外，用于开发/配置目的时，可使用 Micro USB 充电器（推荐 2A）供电。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pxfmini-wiring-quick-start.rst:48
#: c215241031394d479df4cd966180bedd
msgid "Always use a power module to feed PXFmini while flying your drone"
msgstr "飞行时请始终使用电源模块为 PXFmini 供电"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pxfmini-wiring-quick-start.rst:52
#: b458e85abd0e455d911d0ea13f061050
msgid "HDMI Connector"
msgstr "HDMI 接口"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pxfmini-wiring-quick-start.rst:55
#: f32a089f66254c4d8c858cbca4e23686
msgid ""
"If you wish to work straight under your Linux based autopilot, you can use "
"the HDMI connector"
msgstr "如果希望直接在基于 Linux 的飞控下工作，可以使用 HDMI 接口"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pxfmini-wiring-quick-start.rst:55
#: 4b0ee919d3434cb493ca3503a0e32321
msgid "and make your own configurations:"
msgstr "进行自定义配置："

#: ../../source/docs/common-pxfmini-wiring-quick-start.rst:62
#: 34b2fab1e6a64f9dbaef452dbcfe1950
msgid "Connect remote control inputs"
msgstr "连接遥控输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pxfmini-wiring-quick-start.rst:64
#: 482ab3e7a84943d59ab64db582756087
msgid ""
"PXFmini is compatible with PPM remote control (RC) receivers. For "
"traditional single-wire-per-channel (PWM) receivers a PPM encoder can be "
"used to convert the receiver outputs to PPM-SUM."
msgstr ""
"PXFmini 兼容 PPM 遥控（RC）接收机。对于传统的单线多通道（PWM）接收机，可使用 PPM 编码器将接收机输出转换为 PPM-SUM。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pxfmini-wiring-quick-start.rst:68
#: 2462ea4699eb414aac9b0fc59983e167
msgid ""
"For more information see :ref:`Compatible RC Transmitter and Receiver "
"Systems (Erle-Brain 2) <common-compatible-rc-transmitter-and-receiver-"
"systems-erle-brain-2>`. The PXFmini is compatible with the tecnology used in"
" Erle-Brain 2."
msgstr ""
"更多信息请参见 :ref:`兼容 RC 发射机和接收机系统（Erle-Brain 2）<common-compatible-rc-"
"transmitter-and-receiver-systems-erle-brain-2>`。PXFmini 与 Erle-Brain 2 "
"所用技术兼容。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pxfmini-wiring-quick-start.rst:73
#: 5f86a2fecc644c75b972ab21c50fafe9
msgid "FRSky Taranis Transmitter"
msgstr "FRSky Taranis 遥控器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pxfmini-wiring-quick-start.rst:76
#: ecb0aa6b4c8d4547b62c580f05f51f9a
msgid "GPS+Compass"
msgstr "GPS+罗盘"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pxfmini-wiring-quick-start.rst:78
#: 8d6a5ebf164744819589e0b68f4c45cd
msgid ""
"The `uBlox GPS + Compass Module "
"<hhttps://erlerobotics.com/blog/product/gpscompass-ublox-neo-m8n-gps-with-"
"compass-kit/>`__ is the recommended GPS for PXFmini. The GPS port is "
"connected with the six-position DF13 cable, and the Compass port is "
"connected to the I2C port with the four-position JST-GH cable, as shown in "
"the next image:"
msgstr ""
"`uBlox GPS + 罗盘模块 <hhttps://erlerobotics.com/blog/product/gpscompass-ublox-"
"neo-m8n-gps-with-compass-kit/>`__ 是 PXFmini 的推荐 GPS。GPS 接口使用六针 DF13 "
"连接线连接，罗盘接口使用四针 JST-GH 连接线连接到 I2C 接口，如下图所示："

#: ../../source/docs/common-pxfmini-wiring-quick-start.rst:87
#: 87b0daa3635b4bcd90101be3dc25879e
msgid "Connect Motors"
msgstr "连接电机"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pxfmini-wiring-quick-start.rst:89
#: efa1a0df1b7d4d828b48753b2bd8d036
msgid "Use the PWM rail in order to connect them:"
msgstr "使用 PWM 排针进行连接："

#: ../../source/docs/common-pxfmini-wiring-quick-start.rst:96
#: bd628fe7c6a74a818d0b2e2799c6f740
msgid ""
"Be aware of how you connect ESCs wires to PWM rail. The signal wire (white "
"or orange color) should be connected at the top, the ground wire (black or "
"brown color) at the bottom."
msgstr "连接 ESC 线到 PWM 排针时请注意方向。信号线（白色或橙色）应连接在顶部，地线（黑色或棕色）连接在底部。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pxfmini-wiring-quick-start.rst:106
#: 2dec42d469ed4d5188b715441cd9fd54
msgid ""
"For Rovers connect the throttle and steering wires to the main output signal"
" pins:"
msgstr "对于 Rover，将油门和转向线连接到主输出信号引脚："

#: ../../source/docs/common-pxfmini-wiring-quick-start.rst:109
#: 4f4206b827e348aca0610e38247eb97e
msgid "Pin 3 = Throttle"
msgstr "引脚 3 = 油门"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pxfmini-wiring-quick-start.rst:110
#: 11f6a35b0adf4d5c9770beb3415cd69f
msgid "Pin 1 = Steering"
msgstr "引脚 1 = 转向"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pxfmini-wiring-quick-start.rst:115
#: 9a864839428044838c28d03b5612ba6a
msgid "USB ports"
msgstr "USB 接口"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pxfmini-wiring-quick-start.rst:117
#: 5d9ef5dedb20429195c70bc4b64f5fd1
msgid ""
"You could attach different dongle/devices to the USB ports that includes "
"Raspberry Pi 2/3/Zero:"
msgstr "您可以将各种适配器/设备连接到包括 Raspberry Pi 2/3/Zero 的 USB 接口："

#: ../../source/docs/common-pxfmini-wiring-quick-start.rst:121
#: 1c50cdb6dec5404d893a5c320bff2165
msgid "WiFi dongle"
msgstr "WiFi 适配器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pxfmini-wiring-quick-start.rst:123
#: c96c8d3c621144f38bc4bca48ea4e47a
msgid ""
"Use a (regular or high gain) WiFi dongle to create a hotspot that can, for "
"example, be used for sending telemetry data and commands to a Ground "
"Station.  If you use the `images "
"<http://docs.erlerobotics.com/brains/os_images>`__ provided by Erle "
"Robotics, they automatically generate a WiFi hotspot."
msgstr ""
"使用（普通或高增益）WiFi 适配器创建热点，例如用于向地面站发送数传数据和指令。如果您使用 Erle Robotics 提供的 `镜像 "
"<http://docs.erlerobotics.com/brains/os_images>`__，它们会自动生成 WiFi 热点。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pxfmini-wiring-quick-start.rst:134
#: af80acef654942b6ab27aa3ed68de420
msgid ""
"Edimax AC (regular and high gain) are the officially supported dongles. "
"These can be purchased from Erle-Brain with your autopilot/vehicle."
msgstr "Edimax AC（普通和高增益）是官方支持的适配器。可在购买飞控/飞行器时从 Erle-Brain 处购买。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pxfmini-wiring-quick-start.rst:139
#: a9a46135cb00438e8ebf6e082f574874
msgid "Bluetooth dongle"
msgstr "蓝牙适配器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pxfmini-wiring-quick-start.rst:141
#: d3cc07c7f7414f0a900c953c7e2247b6
msgid ""
"Use a Bluetooth dongle to connect additional devices, such as joysticks."
msgstr "使用蓝牙接收器连接其他设备，例如游戏手柄。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pxfmini-wiring-quick-start.rst:145
#: ae254e8bb15247b8a04d20afc4f81405
msgid "You will need to configure BlueTooth interface to make it work"
msgstr "您需要配置蓝牙接口才能使其正常工作"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pxfmini-wiring-quick-start.rst:150
#: 68927ef31176450e8d17fbc1ca8af76b
msgid "Connect other peripherals"
msgstr "连接其他外设"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pxfmini-wiring-quick-start.rst:152
#: 893308bdb9d34a789985bb482f98133d
msgid ""
"Depending on your hardware there may be any number of other peripherals "
"attached, including sensors, cameras, grippers etc. These can be found as "
"sub-pages of the topic :ref:`Optional Hardware <common-optional-hardware>`."
msgstr ""
"根据您的硬件，可能还需要连接其他外设，包括传感器、摄像头、抓手等。这些内容可在 :ref:`可选硬件 <common-optional-"
"hardware>` 主题的子页面中找到。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pxfmini-wiring-quick-start.rst:156
#: d0f1c08895614ab5b1f4adedc9429447
msgid ""
"More information in `official documentation "
"<http://erlerobotics.com/docs/Artificial_Brains_and_Autopilots/Additional_Sensors/Lidar.html>`__."
msgstr ""
"更多信息请参见 `官方文档 "
"<http://erlerobotics.com/docs/Artificial_Brains_and_Autopilots/Additional_Sensors/Lidar.html>`__。"

